95
00:05:29,343 --> 00:05:31,263
Hola.

96
00:05:31,263 --> 00:05:32,263
Dale.

97
00:05:32,263 --> 00:05:33,683
Ok.

98
00:05:33,683 --> 00:05:35,293
Dale.

99
00:05:35,293 --> 00:05:36,293
