173
00:11:12,523 --> 00:11:19,613
Traves, Emilia.

174
00:11:19,613 --> 00:11:21,613
Perdón, no, no es mi problema.

175
00:11:21,613 --> 00:11:25,623
No puedo quedarme casada.

176
