193
00:12:14,863 --> 00:12:17,883
Eso, listo.

194
00:12:17,883 --> 00:12:18,883
¿Sabes qué?

195
00:12:18,883 --> 00:12:19,983
Tenés razón.

196
00:12:19,983 --> 00:12:20,983
Vamos.

197
00:12:20,983 --> 00:12:22,303
¿A dónde?

198
00:12:22,303 --> 00:12:23,303
A mandarlo a la mierda.

199
00:12:23,303 --> 00:12:32,563
