213
00:13:07,193 --> 00:13:09,833
Ay, se agarran de un poco, ¿no?

214
00:13:09,833 --> 00:13:11,503
Ok.

215
00:13:11,503 --> 00:13:12,503
Sí.

216
00:13:12,503 --> 00:13:13,503
